<title>UK: Estonian Investment Bank sets 2-tranche mark bond.</title>
<headline>Estonian Investment Bank sets 2-tranche mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ESTONIAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    40 MLN DEM    BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **25.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+62.5     PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.643</p>
<p> NOTES    **STEPS UP TO 162.5 BP 25.JUL.00 IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    15 MLN DEM    BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **25.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+175 BP   PAY DATE    28.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.808</p>
<p> NOTES    **STEPS UP TO 475 BP 28.JUL.99 IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
